=== erdos_moser_trans_tower_kps2 — Branch I: Erdos-Moser trans on the Mersenne tower ===
Anchors (literature): R(3)=4, R(4)=8, R(5)=14, R(6)=28; 34 <= R(7) <= 47 (NMH 2022).
Forcing floor f(n) >= floor(log2 n) + 1 (Stearns): n=7:3  n=15:4  n=31:5  n=63:6.
Since 63 >= 47 >= R(7): trans(T63) >= 7 guaranteed. Since 31 >= 28 = R(6): trans(T31) >= 6.

